WEBVTT

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:30.170
Beyond this point...

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.840
You will find what you are seeking.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:42.430
<i>I keep having the same dream.</i>

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:47.350
<i>A lone human and I...</i>

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.550
<i>In the dream, we do battle.</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:15.010
Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:26.500
Argonaut
Hero's Return

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:25.710
You're telling the Xenos to die?

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:28.920
What is the meaning of this, Lord Hermes?

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:32.510
It's a trade. No...

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:33.620
I suppose it's a request.

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:38.590
At this rate, eventually you'll 
be found by the Loki Familia.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:42.860
But there is another way out.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.820
If you listen to my request, I'll tell you.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.210
And in exchange...

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.170
<i>Fels-kun! This is bad!</i>

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:55.820
<i>The notes were submerged in water, 
but they maintained their form.</i>

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.810
<i>They're fake!</i>

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.100
<i>Ouranos must have—no...</i>

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.900
<i>That Hermes must have done something!</i>

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:05.040
<i>Are you listening, Fels-kun?</i>

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:11.750
What is your objective, Lord Hermes?

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.180
Those notes of Daedalus's were fake!

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.480
F-Fake?

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:23.420
What does this mean, Goddess?

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:26.030
I don't know.

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.930
I don't know, but I have a bad feeling.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.180
Has something happened to 
Lyd-sama and the others?

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:31.880
What?

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:37.370
Hermes is plotting something. 
There's no mistake about that, but...

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:46.730
Is that...

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.400
What's that?

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.370
Are those monsters?

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:53.940
Where...

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.630
Where are we hearing this from?

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:58.200
Mord, there.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:03:58.970
What?

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:00.170
What is it?

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.960
They're coming this way!

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.420
This is insane!

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.650
What is that?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.010
Run!

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.720
Stay right here.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:19.320
Yes, sir.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:25.160
Adventurers! Subdue them!

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:30.810
Chigusa!

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:32.230
Get them out of here!

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.690
R-Right!

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.860
Come on, this way!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:39.210
Is that... Gros-sama and the others!

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.050
What's going on?

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.370
It can't be.

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:45.880
Why?

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.420
Stop, Bell-kun!

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:51.930
Why?

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:56.380
Why force the Xenos to do something 
like this? Why is it necessary?

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.520
What are you after,

00:04:58.850 --> 00:04:59.880
Hermes?!

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:05.590
I'll have them put on an act.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:08.990
The square is the theater.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:11.710
The residents are the audience.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:16.550
The monsters and adventurers are 
actors with their parts to play.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.920
The stage awaits.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.140
In their time of crisis, 
he races to their aid...

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:24.820
Enter, the gallant hero!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.060
I see.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:33.320
So you are telling us to die 
for that boy's sake, correct?

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.320
To regain the boy's honor,

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:40.140
you want us to be defeated by 
him in front of the people.

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:43.200
It's such a help that you 
understand so quickly.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:44.960
Oh...

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:48.200
I'm not saying that all of you need to die.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.560
If you'd pick three or four of you,
 that would be sufficient.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.730
In that case, I will go.

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:58.550
H-Hey!

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.640
We have no choice in any case.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:07.290
Everything lies in the hands of this god.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.930
Everyone! This way!

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.060
Please follow the directions 
of the Ganesha Familia!

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:21.920
I won't let you go!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.140
Don't panic!

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:34.120
B-Bell-kun...

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.440
Eina-san, please stand back!

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:42.580
Has he lost control?

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.820
Brave gargoyle,

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:48.550
I would like to hear your name.

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:50.500
Gros.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.290
Thank you, Gros-kun.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.010
You may be a monster,

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.980
but I will call you by name.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:57.720
What is this?

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:02.440
This item will react to 
someone important to him.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.730
Target her first for me.

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:06.350
Understood.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:10.510
<i>So this is how I will "repay his kindness"?</i>

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.450
<i>Don't falter, boy.</i>

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.580
<i>If you do...</i>

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.460
<i>I will kill that woman!</i>

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:21.930
Hey!

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.110
What's going on?

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.770
Is it really the Xenos?

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.630
They don't have any reason to run wild.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.120
It's all at Hermes's instigation!

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:32.950
Let's hurry!

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.390
Now, then...

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.400
Sorry, Ouranos.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.360
This is how things turned out.

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:43.810
Coexistence with monsters?

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.330
Don't be stupid!

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:52.170
What would come of overturning thousands 
of years of hate and fated bonds?

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:56.160
A heretical hero? No one wants that.

00:07:57.350 --> 00:08:01.050
This is a return to the origins 
of the hero, Bell-kun!

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:04.340
Let's defeat those monsters.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:07.830
Defeat them and save the people...

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.310
And bloom once more into a hero!

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:11.430
Bell-kun!

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.560
Are we just going to leave things like this?

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:17.900
It's true, if we think of 
Bell-cchi and the others,

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:20.030
then this might be the right thing to do.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:23.760
But abandoning Gros and the others isn't!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:27.430
For only us to make it back... 
That isn't right, is it?

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:29.540
You are wrong, Lyd.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:33.040
I have faith.

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:36.190
That foolish boy...

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:40.030
He will surpass the will of the gods.

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:42.020
<i>Why?</i>

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:44.960
<i>Gros-san...</i>

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:46.910
<i>Why?</i>

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:50.420
<i>It might not be possible now,</i>

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:54.470
<i>but if there are people 
like Bell and the others,</i>

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.880
<i>then maybe our dreams will come true!</i>

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:00.810
Look!

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:02.560
It's the Loki Familia!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:05.890
<i>So this is as far as we go...</i>

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:09.190
<i>But the one who kills 
me will be Bell Cranel!</i>

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:11.220
<i>It must be you.</i>

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:15.290
<i>Steel your will, boy!</i>

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:26.490
Do not yield your will to others.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:28.510
This is...

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.450
<i>your</i> path.

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:57.940
Oh, Bell-kun...

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:00.990
You truly are a fool.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.380
Asfi, make him run wild.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.570
I will not ask for your forgiveness.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:16.260
Bell-kun...

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:34.820
Eina-san!

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:46.870
All this time...

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:50.690
All this time, I kept having this dream.

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:56.810
A dream where a lone human and I do battle.

00:11:57.660 --> 00:12:00.590
Amidst the blood and flesh flying 
as we try to kill each other,

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:03.040
I know we had an exchange of wills

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.260
as the most worthy of adversaries.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.870
Now, to meet that person from my dream,

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:12.550
I stand here.

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:18.380
My name is Asterius.

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:22.320
I wish to hear your name.

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:24.860
Bell...

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:27.340
Bell Cranel.

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.270
Bell, if you would...

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.490
Grant me a rematch!

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:01.010
What are all of you doing?

00:13:01.350 --> 00:13:03.820
All the hard work that Lili and the 
others put in, at risk of death...

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:06.210
Are you trying to make it all go to waste?

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:09.470
N-No! There's a reason for this...

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:12.640
Right now, getting them 
out of here comes first.

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:16.570
Haruhime-kun, you gave 
Wiene the oculus, right?

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:19.690
Yes. When we parted, I gave her my own.

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:20.780
Right.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:23.950
Right now, we should be able 
to all meet up in Knossos!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:45.690
Bell!

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:47.310
Bell-kun?

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:59.330
Hey! What are you doing?

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.680
I'm trying to get to Argonaut-kun.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:06.710
What do you punks think you're 
doing? Stay out of our way!

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:09.660
The kid's putting his 
honor on the line here.

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:12.480
You're the ones who need 
to stay out of the way!

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.390
You really got us, Ottarl.

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:30.100
The reason Ais and the other 
adventurers can't step in...

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:32.110
It's because of you and yours, isn't it?

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:33.970
Everything...

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.990
is as my mistress wishes.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:44.740
Hestia-sama...

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:45.720
Let's move.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.030
Yes.

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:53.950
What is this?

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:56.910
What <i>is</i> all of this?

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:00.390
In the confusion, the Xenos have escaped.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.960
It seems likely that, under the 
goddess Hestia's direction,

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.810
they have headed for Knossos.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:10.520
Because of a single monster,

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.890
everything's gone to waste!

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:19.740
Very well! I will admit it!

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:21.230
I've lost!

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:25.190
How could I have imagined this scene?

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:31.010
In my plan, things would not 
have gotten this fevered.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:34.150
A scene in which this 
battle was surpassed...

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:36.500
It shouldn't have been possible 
to bring such a thing into being!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.850
Did you know, Zeus?

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:44.920
That those who defy the will 
of the gods shine brightest?

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.240
You can do it!

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:49.300
Keep fighting!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.960
Go, Little Rookie!

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:55.770
Go! You've got this!

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:56.980
You can do it! Go!

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:13.600
Honestly, the real court jester here is me!

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:17.190
A sage's wisdom! A hero's plans!

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:19.890
But the thing that crushed a 
god's calculations was...

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:22.290
Pure strength!

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:24.910
You got me.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:28.390
I wonder what the look
 on your face is right now,

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:30.510
Freya-sama.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.110
I'm so sorry, Hermes.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:36.260
I've taken over your show.

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:38.710
And you have my gratitude, too.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:41.250
Come this way.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:45.560
The place for you to settle this...
 is right here.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:49.990
I want to win.

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:51.330
I...

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:52.730
I want to win!

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:03.490
What was that?

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:06.320
We must inform Ganesha-sama!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.540
In a battle between men, 
one must not be ill-mannered.

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:15.250
The safety of the citizens 
is our very top priority!

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.250
Don't stop. Keep going!

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:19.910
Keep moving forward, young man!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.020
Firebolt!

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.990
<i>I want to be stronger,</i>

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.990
<i>so that I never have to lose 
anything ever again.</i>

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.200
<i>I...</i>

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.010
<i>want to be a hero!</i>

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:21.960
Now, we're at one win, one loss.

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:25.080
Bell...

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:27.680
Next time, we settle this.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:44.500
I lost.

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:48.830
But... this was for the best.

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:54.520
There was... meaning to this fight.

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:01.000
That's a lie.

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.420
Being glad I lost...

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:05.480
That's a lie!

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:09.060
I... wanted to win!

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.350
Bell-kun...

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:25.580
I'm really sorry, Fels.

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:28.850
Making you heal everyone with magic...

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:31.590
We've caused you a lot of trouble.

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:32.400
Not at all.

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:36.240
Ever since I decided to 
tie my fate to yours,

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.390
I have been prepared for this.

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:40.930
Thanks.

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.940
Still...

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:46.410
You really have the craziest 
dumb luck, huh, Gros?

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:48.480
I nearly died.

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:49.910
Honestly...

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:52.650
You don't get to say things like that.

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:56.490
I'm so happy for you, Gros!

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:58.750
By the way, Lyd,

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:00.060
what about him?

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:05.250
He's already headed down 
to the lower levels.

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:07.280
Training again.

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:11.760
He said he needs to get even stronger.

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:17.210
I heard that in the end

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:20.050
the Loki Familia wiped out all the monsters.

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:21.650
That's incredible.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:24.440
But I guess we can rest easy now.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:29.590
"The Little Rookie Miraculously Survives."

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:31.390
Honestly...

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:33.440
They just write whatever 
they want, don't they?

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:38.160
It's fine. This clears all 
the misunderstandings away.

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:40.730
Now, everything goes back to the way it was.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.390
Not exactly.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:49.070
Are you all right, Haruhime-kun?

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:51.010
Yes.

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.400
We'll meet again.

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:55.020
We made a promise.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.370
All that's left is Bell.

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:04.210
Hestia-sama, is Bell-sama...

00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:05.540
Yup.

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:08.050
Once again, today he's—

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:14.130
Hi!

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:45.250
Ais-san...

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:49.860
Why... are you here?

00:22:50.850 --> 00:22:52.260
I wonder.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:55.380
If I came here,

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:57.950
I had a feeling I would see you, so...

00:22:58.460 --> 00:23:00.450
Really?

00:23:01.090 --> 00:23:01.890
Yes.

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:05.950
Ais-san...

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:06.750
Yes?

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:11.320
Will you teach me how to fight again?

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:14.990
Even though all that happened?

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:16.450
Yes.

00:23:20.120 --> 00:23:21.930
You don't play fair.

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:25.060
Ais-san,

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:26.540
I...

00:23:28.080 --> 00:23:29.900
want to be stronger.
